• ONCE vs. STICKY Rules:
	• Single <RR> <op> executes in ONCE mode and auto-clears after <op>.
	• Repeating the same prefix (<RR> <RR>) locks STICKY = 1. Local branches (JR, DJNZ, JP rel16) preserve STICKY; CALL and INT/NMI push & clear STICKY (restored on RET/RETI).
